Use io.
Define local values as array<whole number, 7>.
Set item 0 of values to 7.
Set item 1 of values to 8.
Set item 2 of values to 9.
Set item 3 of values to 10.
Set item 4 of values to 11.
Set item 5 of values to 12.
Set item 6 of values to 13.
Let status be 0.
If every x in values is more than 0, add 1 to status.
If some x in values is more than 12, add 2 to status.
If no x in values is less than 0, add 4 to status.
While some x in values is more than 27.
Add 1 to status.
Break.
End the loop.
Say status.
Give back 0.
